flowchart TB
    %% Worked example for VISUAL_SYSTEM_ROADMAP.md Phase 0/1.
    %% Shows the pre-July card aesthetic (stage colors, bold titles, subtitles,
    %% an 'under the hood' second row) carrying the *accurate* July content —
    %% the dual-backend split the old hand-made card was missing.
    %% Two stacked rows are what keep this inside the chat-safe aspect band;
    %% a single left-to-right row renders at ~9:1 and is unreadable at column width.
    %% NOTE: comments must follow the flowchart declaration, never precede it.
    %% NOTE: `direction` inside a subgraph is ignored if the subgraph is itself
    %% linked — so the two rows are laid out unlinked, with invisible ~~~ links
    %% holding the second row horizontal.
    subgraph flow [" "]
        direction LR
        A["<b>Your question</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>Gradio chat UI<br/>tier detection</span>"]
        B["<b>Retrieve context</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>Neo4j graph or<br/>ChromaDB vectors</span>"]
        C["<b>Generate answer</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>Multi-provider LLM<br/>grounded in my KB</span>"]
        D["<b>Streamed reply</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>Cited, logged,<br/>cost-tracked</span>"]
        A --> B --> C --> D
    end

    subgraph hood ["Under the hood"]
        direction LR
        E["<b>Knowledge base</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>Section-aware chunks<br/>3 sensitivity tiers</span>"]
        F["<b>Two live backends</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>Neo4j hybrid or<br/>ChromaDB vectors</span>"]
        G["<b>Multi-provider LLM</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>OpenAI · Anthropic<br/>Google · Ollama</span>"]
        H["<b>Observability</b><br/><span style='font-size:12px'>JSONL query log<br/>latency · cost</span>"]
        E ~~~ F ~~~ G ~~~ H
    end


    A ~~~ E

    classDef s1 fill:#FFF8E7,stroke:#E0A526,stroke-width:2px,rx:8,ry:8
    classDef s2 fill:#EAF7EE,stroke:#34A853,stroke-width:2px,rx:8,ry:8
    classDef s3 fill:#FAEFFB,stroke:#B44FC4,stroke-width:2px,rx:8,ry:8
    classDef s4 fill:#EAF3FE,stroke:#3B82D6,stroke-width:2px,rx:8,ry:8
    classDef band fill:#ffffff,stroke:#d8dee9,stroke-width:1px

    class A,E s1
    class B,F s2
    class C,G s3
    class D,H s4
    class flow,hood band
